    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43808" root="&#xA;                        نبق&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَبِقٌ</span></b> 
                        , properly <i>the fruit of the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِدْر</span> or <i>lote-tree,</i>
is also applied to The <i>tree called</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِدْر</span>
                        <i>itself:</i>
see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَوْمٌ</span>. The fruit so called is a <i>drupe,</i> resembling the crab. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  It seems to be also applied to
<i>A drupe</i> absolutely, or <i>a drupe like that of the</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سِدْر</span>: see its dim., ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُبَيْقَةٌ</span></b>  voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْكَلُ</span>: see also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرْيَانٌ</span>.

